<title>PHILIPPINES: RFM says 1996 net at 503 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>RFM says 1996 net at 503 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food company RFM Corp said on Thursday it posted a net income of 503 million pesos in 1996.</p>
<p>It did not give a comparative year-ago figure but the company has previously reported 1995 net profit at 620.6 million pesos.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it raised its net income target for 1997 to 880 million pesos.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company had said it expected a net profit of 653 million pesos this year.</p>
</text>
